--
N5008 [namespace.udecl]/16, [class.member.lookup]/4: a base-class member
introduced by a using-declaration joins the derived class's same-named members
in one overload set and is not hidden by them.  Regression test for the
"found no match for symbol 'lookup'" front-end bug on CBMC's own namespacet
(namespace_baset::lookup re-exposed in namespacet via `using`).
